{'symbol': 'BXP', 'date': '2023-03-20 07:15:00', 'title': 'BXP DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BOSTON PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: BXP), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED DEVELOPER, OWNER, AND MANAGER OF PREMIER WORKPLACES IN THE UNITED STATES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.98 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK FOR THE PERIOD JANUARY 1, 2023 TO MARCH 31, 2023, PAYABLE ON APRIL 28, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2023.'}